  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Using the vector triple cross product we have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>On comparing both sides we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Using vector cross-product formulae we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
